{"text": "Snowflakes fell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On her long golden hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But she did not think about that. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lights were shining. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From all the windows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a wonderful smell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of roast goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is New Years Eve. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She sat down in a corner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Between two houses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She pulled her little feet under her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But she felt colder and colder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She did not want to go home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had not sold any matches. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So her father would be angry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her home was cold too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because the wind blew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through big cracks in the roof. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her little hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were almost frozen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Perhaps one little match. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Could warm her fingers.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "n", "o", "w", "f", "l", "a", "k", "e", "s", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", " ", "g", "o", "l", "d", "e", "n", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "g", "h", "t", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "h", "i